# Internationalization

- Locales: `de` (default), `en`, `fr`, `ru`, `es` — `localeDetection` is off; `/` → `/de`.
- All user-facing strings live in `src/messages/{locale}.json`. Never hardcode copy in components.
- When adding or renaming a key, update **all five** locale files in the same change.
- Use `@/i18n/navigation` (`Link`, `useRouter`, `usePathname`, `redirect`) for locale-aware routing — not `next/link` or `next/navigation`.
- German URL slugs are canonical across locales (`/en/produkte/...`, not translated paths).
